{"id":"da7cbda57e4d4e17","group":"28","path":"28/28-prop-pairwise-independent-variance.md","title":"两两独立变量和的方差","display":"prop-pairwise-independent-variance — 两两独立变量和的方差","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-prop-pairwise-independent-variance","aliases":["28-prop-pairwise-independent-variance"],"display":"prop-pairwise-independent-variance — 两两独立变量和的方差","depends_on":[],"source_book_location":"Claim A.13","source_printed_pages":"514","source_pdf_pages":"540","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-prop-pairwise-independent-variance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-prop-pairwise-independent-variance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-pairwise-independent-variance — 两两独立变量和的方差"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Claim A.13"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"514"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"540"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 为有限非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\Omega\\to[0,1]\">\\(p:\\Omega\\to[0,1]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{\\omega\\in\\Omega}p(\\omega)=1\">\\(\\sum_{\\omega\\in\\Omega}p(\\omega)=1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_1,\\ldots,X_n,Y:\\Omega\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(X_1,\\ldots,X_n,Y:\\Omega\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr[Z\\in A]=\\sum_{\\omega\\in\\Omega:Z(\\omega)\\in A}p(\\omega)\">\\(\\Pr[Z\\in A]=\\sum_{\\omega\\in\\Omega:Z(\\omega)\\in A}p(\\omega)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb EZ=\\sum_{\\omega\\in\\Omega}p(\\omega)Z(\\omega)\">\\(\\mathbb EZ=\\sum_{\\omega\\in\\Omega}p(\\omega)Z(\\omega)\\)</span>。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in[n]\">\\(i,j\\in[n]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\ne j\">\\(i\\ne j\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\operatorname{Im}(X_i)\">\\(u\\in\\operatorname{Im}(X_i)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in\\operatorname{Im}(X_j)\">\\(v\\in\\operatorname{Im}(X_j)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr[X_i=u,X_j=v]=\\Pr[X_i=u]\\Pr[X_j=v]\">\\(\\Pr[X_i=u,X_j=v]=\\Pr[X_i=u]\\Pr[X_j=v]\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var}\">\\(\\operatorname{Var}\\)</span> 是下式引入的函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var}(Y)\\coloneqq\\mathbb E[(Y-\\mathbb EY)^2].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Var}(Y)\\coloneqq\\mathbb E[(Y-\\mathbb EY)^2].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var}\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^nX_i\\right)=\\sum_{i=1}^n\\operatorname{Var}(X_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Var}\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^nX_i\\right)=\\sum_{i=1}^n\\operatorname{Var}(X_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>展开平方，交叉项 E[(X_i−EX_i)(X_j−EX_j)] 因两两独立等于两个零均值的乘积，故全为零。只需要两两独立，不需要所有变量共同独立；有限空间保证所有二阶矩存在。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Claim A.13；印刷页 514；PDF 页 540。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\Omega\\to[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_{\\omega\\in\\Omega}p(\\omega)=1","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"X_1,\\ldots,X_n,Y:\\Omega\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pr[Z\\in A]=\\sum_{\\omega\\in\\Omega:Z(\\omega)\\in A}p(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb EZ=\\sum_{\\omega\\in\\Omega}p(\\omega)Z(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"i,j\\in[n]","display":false},{"tex":"i\\ne j","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in\\operatorname{Im}(X_i)","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in\\operatorname{Im}(X_j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pr[X_i=u,X_j=v]=\\Pr[X_i=u]\\Pr[X_j=v]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Var}(Y)\\coloneqq\\mathbb E[(Y-\\mathbb EY)^2].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Var}\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^nX_i\\right)=\\sum_{i=1}^n\\operatorname{Var}(X_i).","display":true}],"bytes":1645,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-423","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-lem-probabilistic-method]]、[[28-thm-markov-inequality]]、[[28-thm-chebyshev-inequality]]、[[28-prop-pairwise-independent-variance]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}